      "value": "Here is screenshots of knee folding of avatars with different IK Poses.\nscreenshot1(default IK Pose): avtr_ecd60a3a-e5b2-472b-a213-c31822ba1951\nscreenshot2(AV2FemaleLikeIKPose from booth): avtr_18f1e410-173b-4f55-a577-ea4936d9474d\nscreenshot3(completely broken IK Pose I created): avtr_e7bf2b58-bd46-4bdc-ab04-30caaa59a540\nscreenshot4: Unity preview of broken IK Pose I used in screenshot3. I think this IK Pose should destroy IK completely.\nAll avatars are behave the same. It should behave different.\nScreenshots taken in 2021.2.1p2 [1093] with Valve Index(HMD & controller) + FBT(Vive tracker 2.0 x3).",
